# Local development secrets for `wrangler dev`.
# Copy to `.dev.vars` (gitignored) and fill in real values.
#
#   cp .dev.vars.template .dev.vars
#
# Format: KEY=value, one per line. No `export`, no quotes needed.
# These map 1:1 to the `Env` interface in src/types.ts. In production,
# set them via `npx wrangler secret put <NAME>` instead.

# Required. Anthropic API key — every agent LLM call uses this.
# Get one at https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
